"Audio La Santa Biblia" is an easy to use app with advance features. It is available in five different language English Bible, French Bible, Roman Bible, Spanish Bible, Italian Bible to listen and read. The best part of this app is you can hear audio Bible in the background as well, so you can do your other work along with hearing The Holy Bible chapters.

Features:

- Holy Bible with old testament and New testament;
- Simple and easy to use;
- Great Audio.
- Use either Listening mode or Reading mode.
